      "detalles": {
        "overview": "Órbita is an interactive museographic installation that translates how music recommendation systems work into an embodied, immersive experience. Developed as a thesis project, it integrates user research and an Explainable Artificial Intelligence (XAI) framework, and was validated through three cycles of prototyping and testing with real users.",
        "especificaciones": [
          "User research and Inverted Double Diamond methodology",
          "Embodied interaction design and immersive experience",
          "Iterative prototyping and testing",
          "Explainable Artificial Intelligence (XAI) framework",
